### Description

This is the initial design deployed to have a VPC with subnet and NVIDIA GPU based VSI instance. The VSI instance will be initiated with a custom image rhel.ai. The custom image will be created and saved in a region under the VPC compute custom images. The VSI instance is initialized to serve granite model with RESTful API using nginx https proxy.
The output will have the URL to the API docs

The user inputs look as follows. 

```
