##### Release notes content
The initial code creates

- A VPC
- A subnet with "Allow all" access controls
- A VSI instance with NVIDIA GPU profile and a rhel.ai custom image
- A rhel.ai custom image. The custom image is created by passing the COS URL where the image is stored

